{"2026.6.4:P01-Q27":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>玻璃刻蚀与脱氯离子式</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.4 · 终极押题猜想专题练习 · 押题猜想07 离子方程式书写   第1题 · P01-Q27</div><h1>玻璃刻蚀与脱氯离子式</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：辨析弱酸及沉淀拆写、电子守恒与银氨配位反应。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/碳族元素及其化合物/二氧化硅</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/强电解质和弱电解质</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/沉淀溶解平衡的应用</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>1．下列过程对应的离子方程式书写正确的是</p><p>A．用氢氟酸刻蚀玻璃：<img src=\"chem-asset:6234b28269cb72bcdcf7d2f7544f34bce5cd58dd3fef1947b0d7c01a9817c2fd:0;\" style=\"width:193.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B．工业废水中的<img src=\"chem-asset:00a7a3ae07b98c82001a1f50f5fe7fabada2ee10516d3f959916c2b6c61473fa:1;\" style=\"width:29.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">用FeS去除：<img src=\"chem-asset:0a019cd08560a1cd415626099877777a8727423887ca643a35b38b271a497110:2;\" style=\"width:109.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C．用硫代硫酸钠溶液脱氯：<img src=\"chem-asset:d99689b739d97728f2aec4e9359b4abcafdc3572ae30e079ae1eccd1a3520fb2:3;\" style=\"width:239.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D．浓氨水溶解<img src=\"chem-asset:ad67c89e26d3424b533ec04cef6b1ec912c6213ad57d14f69b2cb30fd68ec79e:4;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：<img src=\"chem-asset:815aab16db203a95c422440a273e9b265865ace0645427222032277693cc77e6:5;\" style=\"width:217.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【详解】A．氢氟酸刻蚀玻璃的反应物为氧化物<img src=\"chem-asset:65f34324c30477a9febed84eb32be53e106a0f05b15d0abf61707d1531158824:6;\" style=\"width:30.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">（不可拆），且HF是弱酸不可拆，选项反应物拆分错误，且F应为<img src=\"chem-asset:5620d21912cd945ceb8774422b96143554d8edd8cd5c3cb31956e888be57822d:7;\" style=\"width:17.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，正确反应为：<img src=\"chem-asset:0471ae8226a6f24b10989435573d5962c6791e69acb51e0afe8732dc8a3a0bfb:8;\" style=\"width:139.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故A错误；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:d23d02c06f0bb637de7bed1c30046b7a405b7b02a1a606c6d47ebba10b95ae48:9;\" style=\"width:25.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是难溶电解质，不能拆写为<img src=\"chem-asset:bae5948b0dded89f8d6ca5bb78c36ff5e2048b18f8d81bf7b8c513b72df58c36:10;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，正确反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:39f83487a68c65db2d101a5fd71d03334c078d774c71dd437245833b8b99a165:11;\" style=\"width:136.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故B错误；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:12;\" style=\"width:22.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为强氧化剂，会将<img src=\"chem-asset:506bd2fc28615db0f631ce87f2e9aa4b843de96e22b75f6604d48a5184dd2134:13;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:344570726616c70acaa7a289b549e9bb9fd14a47fcd0bfa3d9fab42f4a286d2a:14;\" style=\"width:31.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">而非<img src=\"chem-asset:d0442aefd851f2743e5922ec04f7ab3e98308bd08268132b464100cf6397860a:15;\" style=\"width:31.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，且产物中Cl应为<img src=\"chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:16;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，得失电子不守恒，正确应为：<img src=\"chem-asset:b83fa831283f90f3dda3343657f7e72bbb1c02065c332fe83b80d3a53298967c:17;\" style=\"width:248.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故C错误；</p><p>D．AgCl与浓氨水反应生成可溶性银氨络离子，离子方程式的拆分、守恒均正确，故D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）2026年高考化学终极冲刺讲练测\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）2026年高考化学终极冲刺讲练测\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%892026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E8%AE%B2%E7%BB%83%E6%B5%8B/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%892026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E8%AE%B2%E7%BB%83%E6%B5%8B/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["00a7a3ae07b98c82001a1f50f5fe7fabada2ee10516d3f959916c2b6c61473fa","0471ae8226a6f24b10989435573d5962c6791e69acb51e0afe8732dc8a3a0bfb","0a019cd08560a1cd415626099877777a8727423887ca643a35b38b271a497110","344570726616c70acaa7a289b549e9bb9fd14a47fcd0bfa3d9fab42f4a286d2a","39f83487a68c65db2d101a5fd71d03334c078d774c71dd437245833b8b99a165","506bd2fc28615db0f631ce87f2e9aa4b843de96e22b75f6604d48a5184dd2134","5620d21912cd945ceb8774422b96143554d8edd8cd5c3cb31956e888be57822d","60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652","6234b28269cb72bcdcf7d2f7544f34bce5cd58dd3fef1947b0d7c01a9817c2fd","65f34324c30477a9febed84eb32be53e106a0f05b15d0abf61707d1531158824","815aab16db203a95c422440a273e9b265865ace0645427222032277693cc77e6",